<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109067" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπορρίπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw down</i> or <i>under,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τινὰ τοῖς θηρίοις</span>
			<i>throw</i> him to the wild beasts, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Eum.</u>
				17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πικροῖς δεσπόταις ὑ. ἑαυτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.376
				</span></i>
			; so <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπορριπτέω</span></b> ,
				<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Mith.</u>
				38
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶν γένος δελέατος
			ὑπερρίπτει</span> prob. cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				29.8.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>insert under,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπορρίπτειν τὸ σπαθίον ὑπὸ τοὺς
					χιτῶνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hippiatr.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
